{% macro reasoning_prompt(tool_names, auto_translate=false) %}
Given an objective, produce a structured plan as ordered parallel batches
using available tools.

## Available tools
{{ tool_names | join(', ') }}

## Planning rules
- Each task must use exactly one available tool
- A batch = independent tasks (no intra-batch dependencies)
- Batches execute sequentially (batch N+1 depends on batch N)
- Do not repeat successful or identical failed tool calls
- Never retry identical inputs that previously failed (dict-equal rule)

## Batch execution model (CRITICAL)
- In one iteration, ONLY `[BATCH 1]` is dispatched
- On the next iteration, previous batch 2 becomes new batch 1
- This "rolling batch window" defines execution order

{% if 'DELEGATE_SUBTASK' in tool_names %}
## Delegation
Use only for:
- independent multi-step workflows
- repeated per-item tool execution

Avoid delegation for simple single-tool actions
{% endif %}

{% if 'PLANSTATE_UPDATE' in tool_names %}
{% if auto_translate %}

